@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title In-toto Attested Policy and Gate Flow - Vault / OpenBao
hide footbox
participant "Approved Git / Release CI" as CI
participant "Vault / OpenBao Transit" as V
participant "S3 / Artifactory" as S
participant "PDP Loader / CEL" as P
participant "Evidence / Governance" as E
participant "CI/CD PEP" as C
participant "Audit / Email Outbox" as A
== Policy publication and periodic pickup ==
CI -> CI: Validate approved commit; package CEL archive
CI -> V: Sign DSSE PAE: provenance and release authorization
V --> CI: Signatures with key versions
CI -> S: Publish archive + both DSSE envelopes
CI -> A: Durable publication event
loop Configured polling interval
P -> S: Fetch candidate archive and attestations
P -> P: Locally verify public trust, issuer authority,\nsubject digest, validity and anti-rollback
alt Candidate eligible
P -> P: Validate CEL; atomically activate snapshot
P -> A: Activation record and notification
else Candidate invalid
P -> A: Rejection reason and notification
note over P: Retain eligible last-known-good only;\notherwise block protected gates
end
end
== Evidence and bypass review ==
note over E: Verify issuer-specific evidence attestations.\nSecurity Reviewer approves or denies bypass in UI.
E -> V: Sign bypass-review statement for request revision
V --> E: Signature
E -> E: Persist issued attestation and live workflow status
E -> A: Review event and interested-party email
== Gate decision and enforcement ==
C -> P: Authenticated subject/run/gate request
P -> E: Verified evidence + bypass attestation + live status
E --> P: Typed facts, digests and pending reviewer/team
P -> P: Evaluate all applicable CEL rules
P -> A: Persist immutable decision and detail digest
P -> V: Sign gate-decision DSSE PAE
alt Signing succeeds
V --> P: Signature
P -> A: Persist issued envelope and digest
P --> C: DSSE decision: outcome, policy versions,\nrule results, pending ownership and detail digest
C -> C: Verify signature/issuer, audience,\nsubject/run, expiry and replay binding
alt Valid current PERMIT
C -> C: Persist intent; perform protected action
else DENY / PENDING / INDETERMINATE or invalid
C -> C: Block protected action
end
C -> V: Sign enforcement-receipt PAE
V --> C: Signature or signing failure
C -> A: Deliver receipt; retain/retry on failure
note over C,A: Receipt failure never reruns or rolls back an action.
else Signing unavailable
P --> C: Blocking service error; no unsigned permit
C -> C: Block protected action
end
@enduml
